## 5. Current Results (For Reference)

### Within-dataset (train & test on same dataset):
| Dataset | Accuracy | F1 |
|---|---|---|
| UNSW-NB15 | 99.1% | 99.1% |
| TON_IoT | 99.9% | 99.9% |

### Cross-dataset (train on one, test on the other):
| Train → Test | Accuracy | F1 |
|---|---|---|
| UNSW → TON | **23.7%** | 9.1% |
| TON → UNSW | 92.4% | 88.8% |

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> The within-dataset performance is excellent, confirming the models CAN learn patterns. The cross-dataset failure is entirely due to **feature misalignment** and **label incompatibility**, not model weakness.

